WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.376
Nobody moves!

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.089
It's a shame we have to ruin this moment.

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:09.384
Get on your knees,
both hands behind your head.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:10.677
Don't dawdle.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:16.141
This is the FBI.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:20.645
You are all under arrest for smuggling
and illicit drug manufacturing.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:23.023
Come here, Edamura.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.067
You bastard.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.318
You sold us out?

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.990
Now you've done it.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:39.205
You're the ones
who said to protect myself on my own.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:45.420
Don't do it!

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.292
Abbie.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.586
Laurent.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.558
-Edamura.
-Why?

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:42.602
Why did you shoot?

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:45.105
It was the right move.

00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:03.289
-Stop this nonsense--
-Shut up!

00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:05.166
Drop your guns and move!

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.335
I'll kill this woman!

00:02:15.885 --> 00:02:18.096
Come on, get out now!

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.974
Hey Jawface, don't do anything strange!

00:02:21.391 --> 00:02:23.143
Okay, we won't do anything.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.228
Salazar.

00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:27.814
Come, we're running.

00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:34.445
Get somewhere far away

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:36.781
and restart your corrupt life.

00:02:38.241 --> 00:02:39.742
This isn't for you.

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:41.327
It's for Tom.

00:02:44.455 --> 00:02:45.290
Thank you.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:09.355
Get down!

